{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/万丈寒渊","pageid":8266,"revid":20530,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%88%E5%AF%92%E6%B8%8A&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%88%E5%AF%92%E6%B8%8A&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%88%E5%AF%92%E6%B8%8A&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>万丈寒渊</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E4.B8.87.E4.B8.88.E5.AF.92.E6.B8.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"万丈寒渊\"><b>万丈寒渊</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 万丈寒渊.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/2e/b3kctroj88wwdz926hge68jgrenu8v4.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%88%E5%AF%92%E6%B8%8A.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/2e/b3kctroj88wwdz926hge68jgrenu8v4.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%88%E5%AF%92%E6%B8%8A.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/2e/b3kctroj88wwdz926hge68jgrenu8v4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />万丈寒渊\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>远程、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>5*3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）选择自身十字范围内1个地形格，对目标所在的<font color=\"#ed7950\">5*3</font>区域内所有敌人，施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"霜烬\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">霜烬</font></span></span>]，并使地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"永冻冰堑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">永冻冰堑</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）。<br />\n✦攻击前，获得效果：使自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰原之心•神裁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰原之心•神裁</font></span></span>]触发时伤害翻倍，效果持续到下<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次行动开始。<br />\n✦随后，对距离中心最近的<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>名敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>的单体伤害，向中心击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格，并触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰原之心•神裁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰原之心•神裁</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4 5*3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/114hjzvtgpaktcfnraueofrqc3pw6xa.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_5%2A3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"77\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/114hjzvtgpaktcfnraueofrqc3pw6xa.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_5%2A3.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8d/114hjzvtgpaktcfnraueofrqc3pw6xa.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"145\" data-file-height=\"139\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8A%E5%87%A1\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伊凡\"><img alt=\"头像 伊凡.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/be/7ocsfsrm4crs99cz6gjof6rnfy5vb0d.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">伊凡</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164234\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.436 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.616 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9665/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 167543/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12445/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  589.891      1 模板:技能\n100.00%  589.891      1 -total\n  7.77%   45.847      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n  7.05%   41.588      4 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.41%    8.338      1 模板:面包屑\n  0.85%    5.031      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:8266-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164233 and revision id 20530. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"技能","missing":true},{"sortkey":"","category":"毁灭者技能","missing":true}],"images":["技能_万丈寒渊.png","技能范围_1-4_5*3.png","头像_伊凡.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>万丈寒渊</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:技能","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"万丈寒渊"}],"displaytitle":"技能图鉴库/万丈寒渊","wikitext":"{{技能\n|技能名称=万丈寒渊\n|技能图标=万丈寒